5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to be rigorous. I want to look into independent checks on holdings' reported figures and appraisal needs at the last audit.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I'll focus on the human element. I'm choosing retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I would like to see the account retention through price rises and the profile of the exits and the write-off.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I'll take the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, plus the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'm interested in the security review time before first deployment and the delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
