50,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Looking at the candidates, Ledger Bridge is the cleanest for reporting. Harvest Sensor and Fabric Loop bring audit headaches.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Fabric Loop and Harvest Sensor need field crews. I can't support that. Ledger Bridge or Clinic Scheduler are better.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Clinic Scheduler and Harvest Sensor fit the high-retention profile. Fabric Loop looks like the risky operational model I fear.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Ledger Bridge's contracts might be worthless for our credit line. Clinic Scheduler is a safer bet for stability.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Shion,,Clinic Scheduler will hit security review delays. Ledger Bridge is the fastest to deploy.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, but Ledger Bridge is just a dashboard. It's the easiest to verify independently.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Misaki, would Clinic Scheduler's staffing needs be too much for our recruiters?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, the retention for medical practices is historically very strong. That's a huge plus for Candidate A.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I'm worried about the follow-on calls for hardware. That rules out Harvest Sensor and Fabric Loop.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Shion,,"I still think Ledger Bridge is the most efficient. No security nightmares, no hardware delays.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I'm torn, but the audit fees for hardware are a dealbreaker for me. I'll go with Ledger Bridge.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I'll support Ledger Bridge. It avoids the recruitment traps of field operations.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I prefer Clinic Scheduler. The customer loyalty in that sector is too good to pass up.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll vote for Clinic Scheduler. It feels like a more stable long-term asset than a bridge tool.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Shion,,Ledger Bridge is the only one that doesn't risk a six-month delay.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,It's a split. Let's vote.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
